# CI

- Workflows: test (race, shuffle, coverage gate 80% on internal/fs), lint (golangci-lint), security (govulncheck, CodeQL), docker build + Trivy (no push), release (GoReleaser snapshot on develop, tag on v*).
- Dependabot for gomod and actions; no auto-merge.
- Main CI must pass without secret tokens (no Codecov upload required).
